                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Hay to Mr.
                            Rockhill.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1901-04-24"><hi rendition="#italic">April 24,
                        1901</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay states with reference to indemnity that we should be willing to accept
                    bonds. There are inconveniences attending joint guaranty.)</p>
            </div>
